  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I noticed after today’s update, world that I updated earlier yesterday got missing from world list.\nIt includes in-game world list and website view too.\nI also got report from 6 people recently that their world/avatar is missing without them deleted or touched anything.\nThis include some public world (graduate from lab already) with high number of favourites too which is nightmare.\nI personally cannot identify when exactly their asset uploaded got missing at the time but I got this issue this time and found it got missing after VRChat update version. (Maybe 1 of when happen)\nI checked it was there just before update comes into force so I’m pretty sure it got lost by update on server side this time.\nLuckily it was private world for event this weekend which I got sometimes to reuploading it.\n=If you got this issue, you need to=\n*Reupload contents if you don’t mind losing analysis history (visitor count, favourite count)\n*Contact support to recover project from their backup\n     (visitor count and favourite count also recovered)",
